Subject: config: full screen by default

On a console on a TV the game belongs full screen; it used to start in a
640x480 window on the desktop. The saved config and the Options menu still
change it.

Forwarded: not-needed

diff --git a/src/configuration.c b/src/configuration.c
--- a/src/configuration.c
+++ b/src/configuration.c
@@ -103,6 +103,7 @@ config_init (int argc, char **argv)
     gfx.res.x = 640;
     gfx.res.y = 480;
     gfx.bpp = 16;
+    gfx.fullscreen = 1;
     gfx.players = NULL;
     bman.password[0] = 0;
     bman.passwordenabled = 0;
